"Moreover: the low obstructing the high; the young overriding their elders; the distant coming between the close; the new coming between the old; the small overbearing the great; license breaking right — these are called the six contraries.": "1184995d5f26",
"One who loves a son teaches him the ways of right, and does not let him into crookedness.": "17f34aabc000",
